# Gamma Transcendent — ~32 min — alpha 10 induction -> theta 6 -> 40 Hz GAMMA HOLD (audio) -> return alpha 10
# Goal: gamma-supported transcendent / open meditation. Scaffolding for a practice —
#       the device nudges cortical rhythm and theta-gamma coupling; it does NOT install
#       a mystical/non-dual state (that is the practitioner's own attention & training).
# Bands: induction alpha 10 Hz; deepening glide 10->6 Hz; theta-gamma HOLD (theta 6 Hz
#        binaural + 40 Hz gamma nested in a ~6 Hz envelope); return alpha 10 Hz.
#
# *** 40 Hz GAMMA IS AUDIO-ONLY (isochronic mod=40 on ch2). NEVER a light strobe. ***
#     During the hold the LED stays a DIM, SLOW ~6 Hz violet flicker (theta rate),
#     never 40 Hz. This is mandatory safety: no bright 15-25 Hz strobe, and 40 Hz sits
#     above the danger band but bright 40 Hz light is still visually strenuous, so the
#     gamma driver is the audio path only. (Research: altered_states_transcendent_meditation.md,
#     Arc A; guidelines §4.)
#
# Driver: ch1 binaural, freq_r FIXED 210 Hz; beat slides by ramping the carrier
#         (beat = freq_r - carrier): carrier 200 => 10 Hz, carrier 204 => 6 Hz
#         (inaudible <4 Hz carrier move, per guidelines 5a; freq_r is NOT interpolatable).
#         ch2 gamma = 40 Hz isochronic (audio modulation=40), volume amplitude-modulated
#         at ~6 Hz (~34:4:167 = 167 ms ≈ 6 Hz) so the 40 Hz "nests" inside a theta
#         envelope (theta-gamma PAC scaffold). ch1's 6 Hz theta layer runs underneath
#         throughout the hold, reinforcing the coupling.
# LED: dim violet flicker tracks the ch1 beat 1:1 (all <=10 Hz, safe), breathing
#      brightness LFO. NEVER tracks the 40 Hz gamma.
# SAFETY (guidelines §4): every LED rate <=10 Hz (below the 15-25 Hz photosensitive band);
#   brightness capped <=25%, ramps in 15 s and fades out over minutes (both >=10 s),
#   never stopped abruptly; violet only (no saturated red, no red<->blue flicker);
#   binaural carrier 200 Hz (<1000), offset = beat <=10 Hz (<35); volume fades in 60 s.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment
# BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row's value.

# --- Settle / alpha induction (00:00-06:00, beat 10 Hz): vol + light fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 90 0 200 15           # LED 10 Hz violet flicker; brightness ramps 0->20% over 15 s
A 0 200 0 >0 0 1 210 0           # ch1 binaural: carrier 200 / freq_r 210 => 10 Hz beat; vol fades 0->50 over 60 s
S 3000 default 65 "Settle, and let the breath find its own rhythm. Beginning at ten hertz."
15000 10 50 20 90 0 200 15       # brightness reaches 20% (ramp-in >=15 s done)
30000 10 50 ~10:28:10000 90 0 200 15   # breathing LFO: brightness sine 10<->28% over 10 s
A 60000 200 0 50 0 1 210 0       # alpha induction holds: carrier 200, vol steady 50 to 06:00

# --- Deepening: glide alpha -> theta (06:00-12:00, beat 10->6 Hz) ---
A 360000 >200 0 >50 0 1 210 0    # carrier ramps 200->204 (beat 10->6); vol eases 50->40 over 6 min
360000 >10 50 ~10:28:10000 90 0 200 15  # LED flicker tracks beat 10->6, breathing LFO continues
S 360000 default 65 "Drifting down toward theta. Let attention grow soft and wide."

# --- GAMMA HOLD (12:00-24:00 = 12 min): theta 6 Hz binaural + 40 Hz audio gamma ---
A 720000 204 0 40 0 1 210 0      # ch1 theta layer: carrier 204 => 6 Hz beat, held flat (the envelope carrier)
720000 6 50 ~8:25:10000 90 0 200 15     # LED: DIM SLOW 6 Hz violet flicker (theta rate) — NOT 40 Hz
A 720000 200 0 >0 40 2 0 0       # ch2 GAMMA: 200 Hz tone, isochronic mod=40; vol fades in 0->34 over 45 s
A 765000 200 0 ~34:4:167 40 2 0 0  # ch2 40 Hz nested in ~6 Hz volume envelope (167 ms) => theta-gamma coupling
S 720000 default 65 "Rest in open awareness — nothing to do, nothing to hold. The forty-hertz layer is sound only."
S 1080000 default 65 "Let awareness be vast and still, holding everything and grasping nothing."

# --- Gentle return (24:00-30:00, gamma fades, beat 6->10 Hz) ---
A 1440000 200 0 >34 40 2 0 0     # ch2 gamma fades out: vol 34->0 over 60 s, then silent
A 1500000 200 0 0 40 2 0 0       # ch2 gamma off
A 1440000 >204 0 40 0 1 210 0    # ch1 carrier ramps 204->200 (beat 6->10) over 6 min
1440000 >6 50 ~8:25:10000 90 0 200 15   # LED 6->10 lockstep with ch1 beat
S 1440000 default 65 "Gently returning, carrying this stillness with you."

# --- Soft close (30:00-32:00): vol + brightness fade to 0 ---
A 1800000 200 0 >40 0 1 210 0    # beat back at alpha 10; vol ramps 40->0 over final 2 min
1800000 10 50 >20 90 0 200 15    # brightness fades 20->0 (>=10 s), preempts LFO
S 1800000 default 65 "Back at ten hertz. Gently return to the room, calm and clear."
A 1920000 200 0 0 0 1 210 0      # end: ch1 volume 0
1920000 10 50 0 90 0 200 15      # end: brightness 0
